# The session scope after one unbilled turn: Shift-Tab straight to it, Enter
# and Down with no model to act on, r, then Tab round to 30 days.
models models.json
gateway markdown-turn.json
wait 2.5
type explain the plan please
key Enter
wait 5
type /usage
key Enter
wait 2.5
key BTab
wait 1.5
snap session
key Enter
wait 0.7
snap session-expand
key Down
wait 0.5
snap session-down
key r
wait 1.5
snap session-r
key Tab
wait 1.5
snap wrap-30
home end
key Escape
